Package: shareguard
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ShareGuard maintainers
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless | java21-runtime-headless, python3 (>= 3.9), samba, systemd
Description: Local web interface for Samba administration
 ShareGuard provides a browser interface for Samba users, groups, shares,
 configuration, logs and service status. The local package binds HTTP to
 localhost and delegates administrative operations to a constrained helper.
